pageType: final
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |
  结尾页（16/16）：核心信息重述 + 风险提示 + 感谢。
  页面进入自动播放 G1：金句/标题 fade-in → 确定性数字 KPI fade-in → 完成度与感谢 fade-in（依次）；
  点击播放 G2：免责声明条 wipe-in（向上）。
  免责声明为逐字文本（锁文件红线），讲述时不得省略或改写。
elements:
  - elementId: bracket-tl
    elementType: line
    bounds: [44, 40, 12, 12]
    viewBox: [12, 12]
    points: "0,12 0,0 12,0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: bracket-br
    elementType: line
    bounds: [884, 496, 12, 12]
    viewBox: [12, 12]
    points: "12,0 12,12 0,12"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: eyebrow
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 44, 832, 16]
    content:
      style: "$eyebrow"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: "16 · CLOSING"
  - elementId: quote-block
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 72, 832, 64]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-family:Consolas; color:$accent;">NO_TRADE</span> 是成功结果</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px"><span style="font-size:12px; color:$textSub;">决策支持，不做执行、不做荐股；不会为了展示下单而调低门槛。</span></p>
  - elementId: kpi-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [64, 164, 832, 84]
    columnWidths: [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25]
    rowHeights: [0.18, 0.5, 0.32]
    style:
      cellStyle:
        border: null
        align: [center, middle]
        fontFamily: {latin: Arial, ea: Microsoft YaHei}
        color: "$textSub"
        fontSize: 10
    rows:
      - - text: 确定性数字 — 可复算 · 可溯源
          colSpan: 4
      - - text: "7"
          color: "$accent"
          fontSize: 30
          bold: true
          fontFamily: {latin: Consolas, ea: Microsoft YaHei}
        - text: "100%"
          color: "$accent"
          fontSize: 30
          bold: true
          fontFamily: {latin: Consolas, ea: Microsoft YaHei}
        - text: "0"
          color: "$accent"
          fontSize: 30
          bold: true
          fontFamily: {latin: Consolas, ea: Microsoft YaHei}
        - text: "90s"
          color: "$accent"
          fontSize: 30
          bold: true
          fontFamily: {latin: Consolas, ea: Microsoft YaHei}
      - - text: Hero 审计链 SHA-256 记录
        - text: 关键数字与事实溯源率（目标）
        - text: 风控 / 动作泄漏（目标）
        - text: 首次 Replay 价值时间中位数（目标）
  - elementId: completion-thanks
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 262, 832, 134]
    content:
      fontFamily: {latin: Arial, ea: Microsoft YaHei}
      fontSize: 10
      color: "$textSub"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [center, top]
      text: |
        <p>诚实完成度 — 对外只宣传最高已验证切片（当前 P0a Replay）</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px"><span style="font-family:Consolas; color:$success;">P0a</span> · Replay Decision — 端到端已跑通（2026-08-12）</p>
        <p><span style="font-family:Consolas; color:$warn;">P0b</span> · Connected Read-only — OpenD health 已验证；完整 Live 决策链路未毕业</p>
        <p><span style="font-family:Consolas; color:$textSub;">P0c</span> · Connected Simulation — 未毕业，不对外宣称</p>
        <p style="margin-top:14px"><strong><span style="font-size:14px; color:$text;">谢谢评审</span></strong></p>
        <p>GOAI Team · 3 人 — 多 Agent 工程与量化研究 / 港美股期权策略 / 网络安全与合规 · 2026-08 初赛评审</p>
  - elementId: disclaimer-base
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 404, 832, 84]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [5000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#F59E0B1F"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$warn"}
  - elementId: disclaimer-rail
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 404, 3, 84]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$warn"}
  - elementId: disclaimer-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 412, 300, 14]
    content:
      style: "$eyebrow"
      color: "$warn"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 风险提示
  - elementId: disclaimer-main
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 430, 800, 52]
    content:
      fontFamily: {latin: Arial, ea: Microsoft YaHei}
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>本项目仅用于研究、教育与比赛演示用途，不构成投资建议，亦不构成任何收益承诺。</strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px"><span style="font-size:10px; color:$textSub;">研究/教育/比赛演示用途，非投资建议，不构成收益承诺</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px"><span style="font-size:10px; color:$textSub;">决策支持/研究用途，非投资建议，不构成任何交易要约；比赛版本仅支持 Futu 模拟盘且必须由用户独立确认。</span></p>
  - elementId: page-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [846, 514, 50, 14]
    content:
      fontFamily: {latin: Consolas, ea: Microsoft YaHei}
      fontSize: 9
      color: "$textSub"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "16 / 16"
animations:
  - elementId: quote-block
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: withPrevious
  - elementId: eyebrow
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: withPrevious
  - elementId: kpi-table
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: afterPrevious
  - elementId: completion-thanks
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: afterPrevious
  - elementId: disclaimer-base
    effect: wipe-in
    direction: up
    trigger: onClick
  - elementId: disclaimer-rail
    effect: wipe-in
    direction: up
    trigger: withPrevious
  - elementId: disclaimer-label
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: withPrevious
  - elementId: disclaimer-main
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: withPrevious
